Cell["\<\
For translation along x, a horizontal unit bond at y=1 acquires phase -1 when \
Bz=1/2.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1397118513,ExpressionUUID->"e4f49e8b-22e9-7b42-b4d8-dae5d1260e66"],

